        "C. Frank Bennett"
      ],
      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "Antisense correction of SMN2 splicing converted a precise RNA-biological insight into an effective treatment for a previously devastating genetic disease.",
        "attribution": "Krainer and Bennett are a focused pair for the splice-modulation concept and its therapeutic realization.",
        "maturity": "Clinical benefit and the principle of splice-directed therapy are well demonstrated.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The contribution of clinical-development teams and other foundational SMA investigators is substantial."
        ]
      }
    },
