        "nobel_worthiness": "Identification of CFTR connected a common lethal inherited disease to a defined gene and opened molecular diagnosis and targeted treatment.",
        "attribution": "Collins, Riordan, and Tsui are a coherent three-person attribution for the gene-identification effort.",
        "maturity": "The finding is long established and its biological and clinical consequences are clear.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The discovery itself should be distinguished from later CFTR-modulator advances."
        ]
      }
    },
